# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte; EMUSEN_DIANASH_GOLDEN=record rewrites it - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command nano
usage 1   nano <path>                   simple full-screen text editor (Ctrl+O save, Ctrl+X exit - interactive terminal only)

case needs a terminal
target none
covers 1
$ nano a.txt
out 94
nano: needs a real interactive terminal (stdin/stdout is redirected, or this console has none)
status 1
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
1
status 0
action none
$ nano
out 24
nano: usage: nano <path>
status 1
action none
$ nano /../x
out 53
nano: '/../x' is outside the project sandbox (<ROOT>)
status 1
action none
end
